# Build context for images/sandbox/Dockerfile: the three packages it compiles (sources and
# package.json, never node_modules or dist) and images/sandbox. Everything else stays out so
# the context is a few dozen kB and a change there cannot touch any layer.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
.git
.github
.local
.env*
apps
build
docs
scripts
spike-output
*.md
